cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this archived release."
title: "MN transcriptomic signature: analysis code and result tables"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, harmonised metadata and result tables for a compartment-resolved glomerular
  transcriptomic signature and a four-gene classifier for membranous nephropathy. The pipeline
  covers patient-level de-duplication of 13 public GEO accessions, differential expression and
  random-effects meta-analysis, a separability gate, WGCNA, single-cell deconvolution, panel
  selection and validation, and a leakage-audited benchmark of published panels.
